WEBVTT

00:06:59.468 --> 00:07:01.560
Senegal's Cheikh Anta Diop,

00:07:01.584 --> 00:07:04.643
whose seminal work on Egypt is vindicated

00:07:04.667 --> 00:07:07.776
by this discovery.

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:10.863
The last word goes
to the great Jamaican leader

00:07:10.887 --> 00:07:12.852
Marcus Mosiah Garvey

00:07:12.876 --> 00:07:16.052
and the Akan people of Ghana

00:07:16.076 --> 00:07:18.425
with their Adinkra symbol Sankofa,

00:07:18.449 --> 00:07:20.667
which encourages us to go to the past

00:07:20.691 --> 00:07:22.839
so as to inform our present

00:07:22.863 --> 00:07:27.441
and build on a future
for us and our children.

00:07:27.465 --> 00:07:31.682
It is also time that designers in Africa